  t("<b>Plan Balkan = Ismay Plan = Dickie Bird Plan</b>", "By <b>Mountbatten</b>: <b>Dickie</b> = his nickname; <b>Ismay</b> = member of his committee", "<b>Voluntary union on the US model</b>: independence to each province and each Princely State; <b>Punjab + Bengal</b> option of partition; each free to join the CA for a united India or not", "Power to <b>11 provinces separately</b> = <b>balkanization</b> (Nehru's word)", "<b>Nehru opposed at once</b>: not discussed further", w=22),
  bx('ye', "<b>Handout alert:</b> Prelims 1999 cited for Plan Balkan, but the real stem is <b>Prelims 2000</b> (answer c, <b>Mountbatten</b>); teacher underlines Balkan, Ismay and Dickie Bird. Slide note: MTB soon concluded transfer to one central authority was not feasible."),
  sec("10 · 3RD JUNE PLAN / MOUNTBATTEN PLAN " + P('1998') + P('2000') + P('2013'), 'r'),
